menu "AVRCP Cover Art Example Configuration"
    config EXAMPLE_LVGL_BUF_LINES
        int "LVGL flush buffer height (lines)"
        default 20
        help
            Number of horizontal lines held in each of the two LVGL flush
            buffers. Plain ESP32 cannot DMA out of PSRAM, so these buffers
            live in internal DRAM -- keep this modest. E.g. 20 lines * 320px
            * 2 bytes ~= 12.5KB per buffer, 25KB total for double buffering.

endmenu
